                    </table>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#flush">They also received statements both written and oral, from the
                    Austrian Government, reproduced in the following C.F.M. documents: <table
                        cols="5" rend="width: 50%" rendition="#center" rows="4">
                        <row role="label">
                            <cell> C.F.M. </cell>
                            <cell>(D)</cell>
                            <cell>(47)</cell>
                            <cell>(A)</cell>
                            <cell>23</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>“</cell>
                            <cell>“</cell>
                            <cell>“</cell>
                            <cell>“</cell>
                            <cell>54</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>“</cell>
